<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II__cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II__cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II__cl_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Tiada tindakan, guaman, pendakwaan atau prosiding lain boleh dibawa, dimulakan atau dikekalkan dalam mana-mana mahkamah terhadap—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "a" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "Pendaftar, Timbalan Pendaftar atau Penolong Pendaftar, berkenaan dengan apa-apa perbuatan yang diperintahkan atau dilakukan bagi maksud melaksanakan Akta ini; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
