<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_IV__chp_2__cl_11__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_IV__chp_2__cl_11> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
