<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_VI__cl_23__subsec_1__para_c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_VI__cl_23__subsec_1__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "petunjuk geografi itu tidak lagi digunakan atau telah terhenti daripada dilindungi di negara atau wilayah asalnya;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_VI__cl_23__subsec_1__para_d> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_VI__cl_23__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
