<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_85__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Suatu salinan Jurnal Rasmi Harta Intelek hendaklah menjadi keterangan prima facie tentang fakta yang dinyatakan dalamnya."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_85__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_85> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
