<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Garis panduan atau arahan amalan yang dikeluarkan oleh Pendaftar di bawah seksyen ini hendaklah disiarkan dalam Jurnal Rasmi Harta Intelek dan hendaklah berkuat kuasa mulai tarikh yang dinyatakan dalam garis panduan atau arahan amalan itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Mana-mana orang yang dinyatakan dalam peruntukan Akta ini hendaklah mematuhi garis panduan dan arahan amalan itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
