<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Pendaftar boleh meminda keseluruhan atau mana-mana bahagian apa-apa garis panduan atau arahan amalan yang dikeluarkan di bawah seksyen ini."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_XIV__cl_95> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
