<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_1__cl_42__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_1__cl_42__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Penentusahan Pendaftar di bawah subseksyen (3) hendaklah menjadi keterangan prima facie dalam mana-mana prosiding di hadapan mana-mana mahkamah."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
