<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_2__cl_44__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_2__cl_44__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Penolong Pengawal boleh mengambil dan memegang simpan selama apa-apa tempoh yang difikirkannya perlu apa-apa dokumen yang diperoleh di bawah Akta ini."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_2__cl_44__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_2__cl_44> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
