<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_2__cl_46__subsec_3__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "peguam bela dan peguam cara itu hendaklah berhak untuk enggan mematuhi kehendak itu; atau"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_2__cl_46__subsec_3__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_2__cl_46__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
