<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_57> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_57__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
