<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_60> <https://schema.org/name> "Mana-mana orang yang—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/msa@> .
